const taunts=["One tray. Massive flavour. Barely enough washing-up to complain about.","The air fryer earns its counter space for once. Crispy outside, no cremated middle.","Faster than choosing a takeaway and significantly less tragic.","A bowl packed with protein, not the joyless gym-bro punishment you expected.","Creamy, filthy and absolutely not pretending to be a salad.","Fakeaway filth without the delivery fee or the lukewarm bag of regret.","Cheap ingredients, expensive taste. Your bank account can stop whimpering.","Sticky, loud and ready before your patience runs out.","A proper dirty burger. Napkins compulsory; dignity optional.","Throw it in one pot and let heat do the work. Try not to interfere."];
